<item><title>Mali grants Roscan Gold Mali a 12-year gold mining permit</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-grants-roscan-gold-mali-a-12-year-gold-mining-permit-49d5ca/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-grants-roscan-gold-mali-a-12-year-gold-mining-permit-49d5ca/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>The permit covers Kandiolé-Nord in Kayes region, where exploration found a deposit that can be mined economically on a large scale.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 08:10:12 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-grants-roscan-gold-mali-a-12-year-gold-mining-permit-49d5ca/share.jpg" length="40656" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-grants-roscan-gold-mali-a-12-year-gold-mining-permit-49d5ca/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mali eye hospital treats more than 300 displaced people for cataracts</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-eye-hospital-treats-more-than-300-displaced-people-for-d67106/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ml/mali-eye-hospital-treats-more-than-300-displaced-people-for-d67106/</guid><category>Mali</category><description>The Bamako hospital also received specialist equipment worth more than CFA250 million, funded by Spain through its development agency and a foundation partner.</description><pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:53:52 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" length="29829" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ml.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
